<div class="page-header"><h1>导入 <small>---过渡期 Excel 双轨（模板 = 月度工作簿对应表）</small></h1></div>

<% if notice %><p class="d-none"></p><% end %>

<div class="row">
  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card mb-3">
      <div class="card-header"><h5>导入客户订单</h5></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <%= form_tag import_customer_orders_imports_path, multipart: true do %>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <label class="form-label small mb-0">所属月份</label>
            <input type="month" name="month" value="<%= @month %>" class="form-control form-control-sm" required>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <label class="form-label small mb-0">工作簿（「客户订单」表）</label>
            <input type="file" name="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" accept=".xlsx" required>
          </div>
          <div class="small text-muted mb-2">
            自然键 = 订单号 + 通用型号 + 版本；重复导入只更新，不产生重复数据。<br>
            冲销：同一订单号下数量填负数（或类型/特殊要求标注"冲销"），自动生成冲销单「订单号-Rn」，受可冲销余额限制。
          </div>
          <%= submit_tag "导入", class: "btn btn-sm btn-primary" %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card mb-3">
      <div class="card-header"><h5>导入报价</h5></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <%= form_tag import_prices_imports_path, multipart: true do %>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <label class="form-label small mb-0">工作簿（「价格」表）</label>
            <input type="file" name="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" accept=".xlsx" required>
          </div>
          <div class="small text-muted mb-2">自然键 = Price_number；客户不存在的行跳过并进警告。</div>
          <%= submit_tag "导入", class: "btn btn-sm btn-primary" %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card mb-3">
      <div class="card-header"><h5>导入生产订单（六联单）</h5></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <%= form_tag import_sales_orders_imports_path, multipart: true do %>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <label class="form-label small mb-0">所属月份</label>
            <input type="month" name="month" value="<%= @month %>" class="form-control form-control-sm" required>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <label class="form-label small mb-0">工作簿（「生产订单-六联单」表，含订单N/分配量N）</label>
            <input type="file" name="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" accept=".xlsx" required>
          </div>
          <div class="small text-muted mb-2">
            自然键 = 六联单号；导入即已提交（Excel 为准，D14）；分配对直接生成台账，校验差异只报告不自动修。<br>
            分配对「订单N」可写 订单号-行号（AB2026-003-1）或纯订单号（AB2026-003，唯一行自动对应）；前置：客户订单须先导入。
          </div>
          <%= submit_tag "导入", class: "btn btn-sm btn-primary" %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card mb-3">
      <div class="card-header"><h5>导入出库单</h5></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <%= form_tag import_shipments_imports_path, multipart: true do %>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <label class="form-label small mb-0">所属月份</label>
            <input type="month" name="month" value="<%= @month %>" class="form-control form-control-sm" required>
          </div>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <label class="form-label small mb-0">工作簿（「出库单」表：日期/客户/六联单号/产品/数量/快递号）</label>
            <input type="file" name="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" accept=".xlsx" required>
          </div>
          <div class="small text-muted mb-2">
            同（六联单号+日期+快递号）的行合成一张出库单；幂等键 = 六联单号+日期+快递号，重复导入整单重建（Excel 为准）。<br>
            金额列导入忽略（系统按报价成分自动计算）；前置：六联单须先导入。
          </div>
          <%= submit_tag "导入", class: "btn btn-sm btn-primary" %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h4>导入批次</h4>
<table class="table table-striped table-sm">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>时间</th><th>类型</th><th>月份</th><th>文件</th><th>操作人</th><th>统计/警告</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <% @imports.each do |imp| %>
      <tr>
        <td><%= imp.created_at.strftime("%F %H:%M") %></td>
        <td><%= { "customer_orders" => "客户订单", "sales_orders" => "六联单", "prices" => "报价", "shipments" => "出库单" }[imp.kind] || imp.kind %></td>
        <td><%= imp.month&.strftime("%Y-%m") || "—" %></td>
        <td><%= imp.filename %></td>
        <td><%= imp.imported_by&.name %></td>
        <td class="small">
          新建 <%= imp.stats["created"] %> / 更新 <%= imp.stats["updated"] %> / 跳过 <%= imp.stats["skipped"] %>
          <% (imp.stats["warnings"] || []).each do |w| %>
            <div class="text-danger">⚠ <%= w %></div>
          <% end %>
        </td>
      </tr>
    <% end %>
    <% if @imports.empty? %>
      <tr><td colspan="6" class="text-muted">暂无导入记录</td></tr>
    <% end %>
  </tbody>
</table>
